    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Noah Bernett",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112932505611847240059/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWlxd0VRgf4_OScY3IaHx7UYIJzLseN4ZCHV48xHE5w_248AQO5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I was on the highway and my car was making a noise, and figured I should bring it to a mechanic to have it looked at since I had a big drive ahead.\nFound this mechanic on Google they were open nice and early. Called the phone and a gentlemen picked up right away and said they can take a look right away.\nAs we arrived Guillaume greeted us and the sharp mechanic Pierre took a look.\nWithin 1.5 hours we were all fixed up and right out the door.\nThe part I needed came so fast as their supplier was around the corner. I also was lucky to have them lend me a car to go grab a coffee at Tim’s while I waited.\n\nThis place is great people are so nice. Pierre the mechanic was sharp as an arrow and clearly had years under his belt.\n\nYou can count on this place!",
        "time": 1704465979,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Evan harvey",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103997023158676912444/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI096SM3wBagdA3nsPih-sg5y6aUBBfk4oFJD4ti2RBVf7z=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Very good and professional service. Excellent, competitive, fair prices. Everything was explained in detail. My issues with my vehicle were fixed in a great amount of time. Thank you, definitely recommend this garage!",
        "time": 1712170989,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lydia Dancause",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101129532683320685045/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6AZaDDy1c7IDzeyNnT0x4QbucPNGG2HXGvNsnb5It9uFRQLA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I had my tire blow this morning on my way to school, and as I was in a huge panic because I had an exam that morning, they took me in right away. Exceptional service, super accommodating and respectful, very quick, had me out within the hour and not expensive at all. Honestly astonished at this amazing service and cannot be more grateful!",
        "time": 1668706479,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Martin Cloutier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102971163160588731240/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIc14SSZ-6HdFTRY88WrywXL4zwhulxZ0j6_PZ6qItjE71kwA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Yesterday was my first time dealing with them and I was very pleased. New tires were installed as discussed, no surprises. Had an oil change at the same time and they didn't try to 'nickle and dime' me like some other places. They found a small issue and made recommendations, that was it - turns out it can wait until next time. I think I've found a new place to have my car serviced.",
        "time": 1508524627,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "A Arsenault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111445536400588875736/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIzAvfjWbybTMqBayxkvvg668bSFMwvEHzTas91j39uE2Mo6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
